    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/469224b50dcf1a9784a3aedcb3d089de.svg) ⟨28⟩\nHoang17z⟨28⟩\n/\nfl_omr_dataset⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Image ⟨30⟩\nFormats:  imagefolder ⟨31⟩\nSize:  10K - 100K ⟨32⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨33⟩\nCroissant\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨34⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨35⟩ Community 1 ⟨36⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨37⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨38⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\ndefault · 43.5k rows\ndefault (43.5k rows)\nSplit (1)\ntrain · 43.5k rows\ntrain (43.5k rows)\nSearch is not available for this dataset\nSQL\nConsole\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this split.\nServer error while post-processing the rows. Please report the issue.\n\n```\nError code:   RowsPostProcessingError\n\n```\n\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨39⟩, and open a discussion⟨40⟩ for direct support.\n**YAML Metadata Warning:** empty or missing yaml metadata in repo card\nCheck out the documentation⟨41⟩ for more information.\n  * warm_start/⟨42⟩\n  * local/⟨43⟩\n  * FedAvg/⟨44⟩\n  * centralized/⟨45⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨46⟩ FL-OMR-Dataset \nOfficial dataset and pretrained models for the project:\n**Federated OMR for Automated Examination Paper Digitization and Assessment**\nThis repository provides the datasets, pretrained models, template files, and detection model used in our experiments on Federated Learning for Optical Mark Recognition (OMR).\n* * *\n#   ⟨47⟩ Repository Structure \n\n```\nFL-OMR-Dataset/\n│\n├── data/\n│   ├── dataset1/\n│   │   ├── roi/\n│   │   └── sheets/\n│   │\n│   ├── dataset2/\n│   │   ├── roi/\n│   │   └── sheets/\n│   │\n│   └── dataset3/\n│       ├── roi/\n│       └── sheets/\n│\n├── modelAnswer/\n│   ├── metadata/\n│   ├── exam*.png\n│   └── modelAnswer_exam*.png\n│\n├── weights/\n│   ├── warm_start/\n│   ├── local/\n│   ├── FedAvg/\n│   └── centralized/\n│\n├── best.pt\n└── README.md\n\n```\n\n* * *\n#   ⟨48⟩ Dataset Description \nThe repository contains three datasets used in the experiments.  \n| Dataset  | Description  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| **dataset1**  | Original OMR dataset adapted from the work of Afifi et al.  |  \n| **dataset2**  | Additional dataset collected under different acquisition conditions.  |  \n| **dataset3**  | Additional dataset with different answer sheet layouts and writing styles.  |  \nEach dataset contains:\n  * **roi/**  \nCropped answer regions used for EfficientNet-B0 classification.\n  * **sheets/**  \nOriginal examination sheets used for end-to-end evaluation.\n\n\n* * *\n#   ⟨49⟩ Model Answer Templates \nThe **modelAnswer/** directory contains:\n  * examination templates,\n  * answer keys,\n  * metadata required for ROI extraction and automatic grading.\n\n\nThese files are necessary to reproduce the complete OMR pipeline.\n* * *\n#   ⟨50⟩ Pretrained Models \nThe **weights/** directory contains all trained EfficientNet-B0 checkpoints.\n###   ⟨42⟩ warm_start/ \nWarm-start model used to initialize the Local, Federated, and Centralized training processes.\n###   ⟨43⟩ local/ \nModels trained independently on each client.\n###   ⟨44⟩ FedAvg/ \nGlobal model obtained using the Federated Averaging (FedAvg) algorithm.\n###   ⟨45⟩ centralized/ \nModel trained using centralized learning on the merged training datasets.\n* * *\n#   ⟨51⟩ YOLO Detection Model \n\n```\nbest.pt\n\n```\n\nYOLO model used to detect answer bubbles before ROI classification.\n* * *\n#   ⟨52⟩ Experimental Pipeline \nThe complete OMR pipeline consists of the following stages:\n  1. Detect answer bubbles using YOLO.\n  2. Align examination sheets with the template.\n  3. Crop answer regions (ROI).\n  4. Classify each ROI using EfficientNet-B0.\n  5. Generate the final grading results.\n\n\n* * *\n#   ⟨53⟩ Acknowledgement \nPart of **dataset1** is adapted from the OMR dataset introduced by Afifi et al.\nThe additional datasets (**dataset2** and **dataset3**) were collected and constructed for evaluating Federated Learning under heterogeneous data distributions.\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    66\nNumber of rows: 43,464 Total file size: 975 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨54⟩ Privacy⟨55⟩ About⟨56⟩ Careers⟨57⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
